::MODULE{PUBLISHER|title:站主公开信息 人工填写 不许AI编}
  contact_email | leophdtech@gmail.com
  about_operator | 

::MODULE{FIELDS|title:每条优惠提取什么}
  title benefit conditions code code_required price currency offer_url valid_until valid_until_note source_url fetched_at status snippet

::RULE{benefit conditions code valid_until⇒只能从官方页原文抽出 抽不出就留空}
::RULE{valid_until 官方页没写⇒写 valid_until_note=官方页未标 不许估日期}
::RULE{code_required⇒有码写 yes 官方写明无需码写 no 否则留空}

::MODULE{RENDER|title:页面渲染规则}
  pages: index provider deal compare
  update_cron: every_6_hours
  language: en-US
  affiliate_note: Links may be affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. Commissions follow each network's public terms.

